{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/suffixstructures\/suffixtree"]}],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SuffixTree"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Symbol"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Symbol"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every suffix of every text ends at a leaf, the empty suffix included, and every internal node","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is a point where suffixes that agree so far go different ways, so the tree has at most 2","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"text":" + 1","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nodes. A pattern is found in O(","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"m","type":"text"}]},{"text":") steps down from the root, and the leaves below where it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ends are its occurrences.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let tree = SuffixTree(\"banana\")","tree.occurrences(of: \"ana\").map(\\.range)   \/\/ [3 ..< 6, 1 ..< 4]","tree.longestRepeatedSubstring?.range       \/\/ 3 ..< 6, \"ana\"","","let both = SuffixTree(texts: [\"xabxac\", \"abcabxabcd\"])","both.longestCommonSubstring                \/\/ text 1, 3 ..< 7: \"abxa\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Nodes are numbered in preorder from the root at 0, so a node’s subtree is the nodes from it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"just before the next node that is not its descendant. Children come in the order of the symbol"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that starts their edge: sorted when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Symbol"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Comparable"},{"type":"text","text":", so the leaves are in the order of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"their suffixes and match a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixArray","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" of the same text; otherwise in the order the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"symbols first occur in the texts. Each text ends in a terminator of its own that sorts before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every symbol and belongs to no label."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tree converts to Grafluent’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"RootedTree","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with ","type":"text"},{"code":"RootedTree(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and its suffix links are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a directed graph, ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/suffixLinksView-swift.property","isActive":true},{"text":". Each node takes 32 bytes and each symbol 4 more, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"texts’ codes, which the tree keeps.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SuffixTree","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"SuffixStructures"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"SuffixTree.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/GrafluentCollections\/blob\/main\/Sources\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree.swift#L29"},"title":"SuffixTree","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SuffixTree"}],"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:16SuffixStructures0A4TreeV","role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/Occurrence","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/SuffixLinksView-swift.struct"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/init(texts:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/longestCommonSubstring","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/longestRepeatedSubstring","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/nodeCount","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/nodes","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/root","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/suffixLinksView-swift.property","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/textCount"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/children(of:)","doc:\/\/Suf